mat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bd88e90dee1aafd43c5136db39342130 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5e4c9bd/uploads/origins/0dd91996-e2db-4a23-b544-196b9282baaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=414e51cf4948f8c3823afb69767dcef3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/169", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bdde8e4/uploads/origins/1d6d74cb-4fc0-4797-9095-c86f9d6a8648?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7004f67b98b31e93b77843cf7fc0dba0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2bdde8e4/uploads/origins/1d6d74cb-4fc0-4797-9095-c86f9d6a8648?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7004f67b98b31e93b77843cf7fc0dba0, https://si.imgix.net/2bdde8e4/uploads/origins/1d6d74cb-4fc0-4797-9095-c86f9d6a8648?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7478e2af76ad345369aa74f52db9d0eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2bdde8e4/uploads/origins/1d6d74cb-4fc0-4797-9095-c86f9d6a8648?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d27c24b28e5f322a6564a530f1b1a4fd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Draw the character ルーデウス・グレイラット. Draw him wearing the second robe that he used when he was rescuing his mother (see images 1,2, and 3 in the folder). Draw him armed with his staff. Draw the front side of his body. Draw his entire body. Draw magical energy surrounding him in the air. Please make sure that his demon eye is also visible. Draw any other details you would like into the image.\n\nReference Folder (the decorative white embroidery seen on his robe is different in the animated series than in the Light Novel illustrations. You can decide which version to draw)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fhDgyXg8knRyxXhOHJHBWi3tAYvp_MYZ?usp=sharing\n\n///////////\nキャラクター「ルーデウス・グレイラット」を描いてください。\n彼が母親を救出する際に着ていた2番目のローブを着た姿を描いてください（フォルダ内の画像1、2、3を参照）。\n彼が持っている杖も装備させてください。\n体の正面を描いてください。\n全身を描いてください。\n彼の周囲の空中に魔力が漂っている様子を描いてください。\n魔眼が見えるようにしてください。\nそのほか、あなたが描きたいと思うディテールも自由に加えてください。\n\n参考フォルダ：\n（ローブの装飾的な白い刺繍は、アニメ版とライトノベルの挿絵で異なります。どちらのバージョンを描くかはお任せします）", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/168", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c901a8/uploads/origins/688fbffc-0090-42b2-9d95-ea76ebc81d5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e16d08316d41b718b37d294517c2a848", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c901a8/uploads/origins/688fbffc-0090-42b2-9d95-ea76ebc81d5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e16d08316d41b718b37d294517c2a848, https://si.imgix.net/a7c901a8/uploads/origins/688fbffc-0090-42b2-9d95-ea76ebc81d5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=58cf17d0a0129215f866bf7b1d24340c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c901a8/uploads/origins/688fbffc-0090-42b2-9d95-ea76ebc81d5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f365177ac84cd9fad46762cce53f03cd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/167", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41ea623c5374efb53eac75e8d1811104", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41ea623c5374efb53eac75e8d1811104, https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cc92a8c7c7dce73480cb15e2a5348cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed4deacb/uploads/origins/825de5f4-98a1-439d-bb52-f81382c50991?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05f993452c7e66eb42da426c08db4162 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ルイジェルド・スペルディアというキャラクターを描く。槍で武装した彼を描く。体の前側を描く。全身を描く。頭髪を描く（フォルダ内の画像1を参照）。額に埋め込まれた赤い石を描く。可能であれば、坊主頭とヘッドバンドを別レイヤーで描いてください（リファレンス・フォルダーの画像2を参照）。ポーズは何でもよい。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Cw578fLDKmlItWnI__Tr8xyX-V3AMiOQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tochikeisuke/works/166", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/655a8bdd/uploads/origins/065b5fb6-89cf-44c8-b600-b89ccb17a9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5eac884fb8b938bf800a22f502b04dea", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/655a8bdd/uploads/origins/065b5fb6-89cf-44c8-b600-b89ccb17a9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5eac884fb8b938bf800a22f502b04dea, https://si.imgix.net/655a8bdd/uploads/origins/065b5fb6-89cf-44c8-b600-b89ccb17a9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ffcf4e1305ec76126cc91d26648992cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/655a8bdd/uploads/origins/065b5fb6-89cf-44c8-b600-b89ccb17a9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress